  <p class="eyebrow">The idea</p>
  <h2 class="sec">The idea, in three beats.</h2>
  <div class="beat">
    <h3>Everything that keeps you alive got more expensive.</h3>
    <p>Shelter, food, power, care. The basics, not the luxuries.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="beat">
    <h3>Almost everything else got cheaper to make.</h3>
    <p>Automation, robotics and software kept driving production costs down.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="beat">
    <h3>Nobody is pointing the cheap machines at the expensive problems.</h3>
    <p>That’s the gap Uncost works in.</p>
  </div>
